cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Norma in published work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Norma.jl"
abstract: >-
  A Julia code for testing algorithms for coupling and multiphysics,
  primarily in solid mechanics and heat conduction: nonlinear finite
  elements with implicit and explicit time integration, contact, reduced
  order models by operator inference, and overlapping and nonoverlapping
  Schwarz alternating methods.
